        "comments": "The assembly cbHedStel2.2 is based on 55x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and plastid genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, the primary assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. Order and orientation of scaffolds on Chromosome 1 from\n32.60-33.09Mb, Chromosome 2 from\n2.54-2.64Mb, Chromosome 8 from\n10.64-10.70Mb and Chromosome 10 from\n2.72-2.80Mb is unsure.",
